            "text": "{\"task_id\":\"bbd1046b-cc85-4144-ace2-3ced6c778ce5\",\"metadata\":{\"prompt\":\"Recreate the motion of the reference video in a sunlit park.\",\"model_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Video 1> is the source video providing the 1.00-second temporal pacing and a counting-down indicator structure.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[video generation + reference generation] The target video recreates the 1.00-second timing and indicator structure of <Video 1> in a sunlit park.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Video 1> (timing and pacing structure): weak_reference - the 1.00-second duration and sequential indicator pacing are adopted.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\nThe target video is a live-action, cinematic outdoor scene in a sunlit park with lush green grass and towering oak trees casting soft shadows.\\n[Shot 1] A medium shot frames a clear grassy park path bathed in warm afternoon sunlight, with a glowing white digital number \\\"0\\\" visible in the air on the right side of the frame as the 1.00-second video begins. The camera holds a static shot as a gentle breeze rustles the leaves overhead and sunlight glints off the blades of grass.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nA gentle park breeze rustles through tree leaves, accompanied by distant faint bird chirps.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nN/A\",\"prompt_expansion_elapsed_ms\":2093,\"prompt_enhancement_level\":null,\"high_motion\":null,\"optimization_level\":\"LOW\",\"optimization_level_adjusted_from\":null,\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3-Omni\",\"task_type\":\"R2V\",\"seed\":115795,\"fps\":null,\"height\":768,\"width\":1344,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"resolution_label\":null,\"duration_secs\":1.0,\"num_frames\":null,\"src_image_urls\":null,\"input_video_secs\":4.0,\"src_video_urls\":[\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/d885599410f0a904c1d78ab74019e6a5fa97f00e/tests/fixtures/seedance-ref.mp4\"],\"src_audio_urls\":null,\"src_file_urls\":null,\"src_webpage_urls\":null,\"acceleration\":null,\"adapter\":null,\"draft\":